  <a href="https://github.com/plotly/datasets" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plotly <code>datasets</code> repository</a>
  (MIT license), originally derived from U.S. Census TIGER data — full provenance in
  <a href="/ca-sea-change-atlas/data/coverage/ATTRIBUTION.md">data/coverage/ATTRIBUTION.md</a>. Flood-depth overlay: live map layers from
  <a href="https://explorer.adaptingtorisingtides.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BCDC's Adapting to Rising Tides Bay Shoreline Flood Explorer</a> —
  planning-level only, not for parcel-scale, permitting, or engineering use; see
  <a href="https://explorer.adaptingtorisingtides.org/about/a-disclaimer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their full disclaimer</a>.
  Base map &copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors. Address search via
  <a href="https://nominatim.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap Nominatim</a>. Full license list:
